      "message": "Thanks, yeah good points and agreed, we can always add more tests in a follow-up as you suggest wherever it makes sense.\n\nTo answer your questions:\n\n- Calling updateConfiguration on a downed interface will bring the interface up with the new configuration (we may want to change this behavior in the future).\n- Calling disable interface on an untracked interface will result in an error (we have unit test coverage on this).",
